{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21009","headline":"贝宫夫人 · 李贺","name":"贝宫夫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丁丁海女弄金环，雀钗翘揭双翅关。\n六宫不语一生闲，高悬银牓照青山。\n长眉凝绿几千年，清凉堪老镜中鸾。\n秋肌稍觉玉衣寒，空光帖妥水如天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}